name=REAL Zomboid Console Emulation
id=PZEMU
require=PZFB
description=Collectible retro game consoles and cartridges. Find NES, SNES, Genesis, Game Boy, Atari 2600, Game Gear, and Master System consoles during loot runs and play real retro games on in-game TVs (libretro emulation). Place your own legally obtained ROM files in Zomboid/PZEMU/roms/ (nes/, snes/, genesis/, gb/, atari2600/, gg/, sms/); the full game list and ROM names are in GAMES.md on GitHub. v0.8.0: volume control (- / = / M), remappable keys with a WASD preset (Controls... button), handheld batteries that drain and can be swapped, in-game saves that survive closing, greyed-out menu options that say why, "NES: Contra" item names. Linux and Windows. Multiplayer: each player runs their own emulator locally (no frame sync); PZFB and PZEMU must be installed on every client. Requires PZFB 1.7.0 or newer; PZFB 1.8.0 recommended (graceful saves, safe alongside PZVP/PZDOOM, long-session crash fix).
url=https://github.com/expectbugs/pzemu
